            "title": "Die neue Sammlung von Betrachtungen ist hier",
            "summary": "Es ist eine Sammlung von Alltäglichem. Du kannst es hier anschauen: Sammlung 45t Es gibt Absurdes und Unangenehmes: Auch verschiedene Nahrungsmittel sind vertreten: Und es gibt Aufforderungen: Es gibt auch einige Tiere (die gehören mir nicht):",
            "content_html": "<p>Es ist eine Sammlung von Alltäglichem. Du kannst es hier anschauen: <a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/sammlung-45t.html\">Sammlung 45t</a></p>\n<p>Es gibt Absurdes und Unangenehmes:</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"8\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8444.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8444-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8611.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8611-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9396.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9396-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8883.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8883-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9166.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9166-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9126.jpeg\" data-size=\"2798x3730\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9126-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8300.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8300-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9321.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9321-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>Auch verschiedene Nahrungsmittel sind vertreten:</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"7\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_0058.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_0058-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8133.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8133-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_7964.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_7964-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8334.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8334-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8620.jpeg\" data-size=\"2314x3085\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8620-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8897.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8897-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_0130.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_0130-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>Und es gibt Aufforderungen:</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_0220.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_0220-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_7938.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_7938-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9342.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9342-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>Es gibt auch einige Tiere (die gehören mir nicht):</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"6\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8068.jpeg\" data-size=\"2619x3493\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8068-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9943.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9943-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8369.jpeg\" data-size=\"2679x3572\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8369-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"960\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8394.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8394-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8091.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8091-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8866.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8866-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9340.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9340-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8075.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8075-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8399.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_8399-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9636.jpeg\" data-size=\"3088x2316\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9636-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9423.jpeg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://kunstmanu.ch/media/posts/90/gallery/IMG_9423-thumbnail.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>",
